<title>USA: Globe acquires Apartment Furniture.</title>
<headline>Globe acquires Apartment Furniture.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globe Business Resources Inc said on Friday it acquired all furniture rental contracts and other assets of privately-owned Apartment Furniture Rental Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Apartment Furniture, based in Michigan, rents and sells residential furniture. Annual revenues are approximately $5 million.</p>
